263
00:18:25.333 --> 00:18:28.067
Magandang plano yan Madam.

264
00:18:28.067 --> 00:18:32.867
[Ospital ng Gaseong]

265
00:18:32.867 --> 00:18:35.300
Sige, simula ngayon,
kabilang sa mga bangkay na pumasok kahapon,

266
00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.133
