303
00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:53.333
ha?

304
00:21:53.333 --> 00:21:57.667
Oh, isinara ko ito pagkatapos ng isang malaking scam.

305
00:21:57.667 --> 00:21:59.433
Pero bakit biglang tanong?

306
00:21:59.433 --> 00:22:01.700
Gusto kong magbihis ng matingkad bukas.

307
00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:05.133
Hindi mahinhin at matikas,

308
00:22:05.133 --> 00:22:08.333
