422
00:32:28.800 --> 00:32:30.900
Malapit nang mailabas si Dong Min.

423
00:32:30.900 --> 00:32:34.133
Kapag napatunayan natin na si Ga Seon Yeong ang nasa likod ni Gil Ho Se,

424
00:32:34.133 --> 00:32:37.233
